  "foaf:name": "VOA – Oceanographic Sailing Vessel",
  "sdo:name": "VOA – Oceanographic Sailing Vessel",
  "sdo:description": "The VOA - Veleiro Oceanográfico Arqueiro is a new initiative focused on developing a state-of-the-art oceanographic sailing vessel designed for long-term, multidisciplinary ocean monitoring and research. The project aims to gather high-quality oceanographic data while minimizing environmental impact, leveraging the efficiency of sailing vessels for scientific exploration. This aligns with the Ocean Decade&#x27;s goal for sustainable ocean science, contributing to efforts in understanding the ocean-climate nexus, monitoring ecosystems, and ensuring ocean sustainability.",
